coaches have USFSA/USA Hockey registration number which they will enter at sign up. 
This number will be their coach code and will show up on their students profile page along with the coach name.  *Abandoned 2026-10-12 (ADR-029): no way to verify it is valid and for hockey this code changes. Implementing it adds more complexity for no reward.*

This registration number is provided by the USFSA/USA Hockey organization and changes each year. See if there is an API to hook into to validate a number.  *Abandoned. no way to verify it is valid and for hockey this code changes. Implementing it adds more complexity for no reward.* 

Coaches will need to add their new number each year. The old numbers will either need to be kept or the reoccurring bookings will need to be updated with the new number. *Settled: bookings and recurrences use the coach's internal ID, never the code, so a code change doesn't touch them (Open-Pending §2).*



